    "updated_at": "2022-02-25T17:00:43Z",
    "body": "I don't think this is really intentional. It's just a historical artifact of how DOMException has custom bindings, and nobody ever implemented this. See https://github.com/whatwg/webidl/pull/378 and in particular the second comment there.\r\n\r\nIMO we should change this and it shouldn't be risky.",
