    "created_at": "2024-07-01T02:33:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-07-01T02:33:32Z",
    "body": "Summary of work to be done here:\r\n\r\n- Actually update the spec.\r\n  - https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#create-an-interface-object needs a special case where if _I_ is `DOMException`, then _constructorProto_ should be set to realm.[[Intrinsics]].[[%Error%]].\r\n  - Add a \"statement of fact\" (not a normative requirement) to https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#js-DOMException-specialness referring to the above normative requirement on the interface object's [[Prototype]]. Similar to how we currently discuss the interface prototype object's [[Prototype]].\r\n- Update this test https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/blob/c267e5afc956cf18849a30aa4faf0eb3d3031a5d/webidl/ecmascript-binding/es-exceptions/DOMException-custom-bindings.any.js#L11-L13\r\n- File various bugs (the pull request template contains guidance on this)",
