    "updated_at": "2026-01-20T19:37:55Z",
    "body": "This came up today in a TC39 side discussion that sprung out of two new `Error` proposals.\nSome folks wondered whether it would it be web-compatible to simply make `DOMException` inherit from `Error` properly?",
